==Vietnamese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*ʔeː||who}}. Cognate with {{cog|tou|-}} [Cuối Chăm] ''ʔeː¹''.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-ai.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Pronoun===
{{vi-pronoun|埃}}

# [[who]]
#: {{ux|vi|[[bạn|Bạn]] là '''ai'''?|'''Who''' are you?}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Ai''' (mà) biết.|Who knows? / How should I know?}}
# [[whoever]]
# [[someone]] [[else]]
# [[one#Pronoun|one]], a [[person]]
#* '''2005''', Nguyễn Ngọc Tư, "Cuối mùa nhan sắc" (in ''Cánh đồng bất tận''), Trẻ publishing house
#*: {{quote|vi|Người ở chùa, người bán vé số, người ngủ công viên, người hát rong, ít '''ai''' có nhà để về.
|translation=Some live at the temple, some sell lottery tickets, some sleep in parks, some play music in the streets; few have a home to go back to.}}
# {{lb|vi|rhetorical}} [[nobody]]

====Usage notes====
* The interrogative pronoun ''ai'' is used for a person. When ''ai'' functions as the subject of the question, it is placed at the beginning of the question.
:: {{uxi|vi|'''Ai''' có ô tô?|Who has a car?}}
* When functioning as the predicate, it can either follow or predate the linking verb {{m|vi|là}}.
:: {{uxi|vi|Hải là '''ai'''?|Who is Hải?}}
:: {{uxi|vi|'''Ai''' là Hải?|Who is Hải?}}
* When functioning as the object, it is placed after the verb.
:: {{uxi|vi|Nga vẽ '''ai'''?|Whom is Nga drawing?}}

====See also====
{{vi-der|ai đó|ai ai|ai nấy}}

